Jade for Sunrise
================

This mod is a clean-room port of the behaviour of Jade, the "what am I looking at" overlay for
Minecraft by Snownee (the successor of HWYLA/WAILA), to Sunrise. Jade is:

  Copyright (c) Snownee and contributors
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
  (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
  https://github.com/Snownee/Jade

No Jade source code and no Jade art is in this mod. It was written from a description of Jade's
observable behaviour (SPEC.md): what the overlay shows, its options and their defaults, and its
user-facing strings. Every sprite it draws is either the game's own (hearts, armour) or drawn from
plain fills (the box, the progress arrow, the check and the cross).

This port is offered under the same licence, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE), so it can be shared on
Jade's terms: credit Snownee's Jade, no commercial use, share alike.

This is an unofficial port. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Snownee, the Jade team,
Mojang, Microsoft or the Sunrise project.

Sunrise is a Rust reimplementation of Minecraft: Java Edition. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang
Synergies AB. This mod contains no Minecraft code or assets; it reads the game's own files at run
time.
